{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:45 2026-07-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:45 2026-07-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:45 2026-07-17 HKT</p><p>由鄭保瑞執導，林峯、劉俊謙、胡子彤、張文傑領銜等主演的電影《九龍城寨之終章》，劇組經過一連三晚趕拍廟街外景戲份，昨晚已順利完成拍攝，工作人員今日在現場逐一清拆道具佈景，未見導演和演員現身。</p><img alt=\"今日低調清場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1441e8882ef509b6d0de40b6b78b65da/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_42_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"拆走道具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2fab74549da8e74b26c148708501a4cb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_42.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"舊式橙色垃圾桶好經典。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c3e5c5e90c5cd462a818f151f2736fb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_43_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"廟街三晚外景煞科。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e09e3a6818f7a5cf58f759497621e5b6/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_43_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工作人員整理現場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/89fc6c3e886b2701e94117423388d6d7/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_43.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"搬走道具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c85329d2d10481233d79cda5fdfe2a50/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_18_23_44.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"昨晚拍「十二少」胡子彤打鬥場面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/50e21321f7a2ae91fe9ec8738ef08ae6/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-16_at_20_32_24_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"封街取景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d6a0bba469c9ddc5b5802487a27e4dc9/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-16_at_20_32_26_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林峯晚上九時到廟街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/363fe8787234f4394437dbb661aa1df5/2026-07/9_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T11:58:35.574497+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}